    <div class="WrapperContainer">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <div class="headingSection text-center">
                        <h3>
                            Crafting Style, Comfort & Joy for Your Little Ones
                        </h3>
                        <h2>Welcome <span class="color2">to </span> <span class="color3">Mini Style</span></h2>
                        <div class="headingDescription">
                            <p>We bring trendy, comfortable, and high-quality clothing for kids aged 0 to 12 years, ensuring every little one looks adorable and feels great.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="Paragraph">
                    <p>At Mini Style, we believe that every child deserves the best in fashion, comfort, and quality. As a trusted clothing brand, we offer a delightful collection of stylish and comfortable outfits for kids aged 0 to 12 years. Whether you’re shopping for <span>playful boys, charming girls, adorable newborns,</span> or <span>versatile unisex apparel</span>, we have something special for every little one.</p>

                    <p>Our collection is designed with <span>carefully selected fabrics, ensuring breathability, durability, and comfort</span> for all-day wear. From trendy casuals to elegant occasion wear, Mini Style brings a perfect blend of fashion and functionality for your child’s wardrobe.</p>

                    <p>With a commitment to <span>quality, affordability, and style</span>, Mini Style is here to dress your little ones in outfits that make them shine. Explore our collection and find the perfect look for every moment!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
